        <summary ToolPath="TrimmedButTooLong" tool="FirstSentenceInJavadocToMdoc">
          <para>Flag for setApplicationEnabledSetting(String,int,int) and setComponentEnabledSetting(ComponentName,int,int): This component or application is in its default enabled state (as specified in its manifest). Explicitly setting the component state to this value restores it's enabled state to whatever is set in the manifest.</para>
